Velox: reserve the ASG duplex buffer when the context is created (VELOX_ASG_DUPLEX=1).
Fixes v2 falling back to v1 when the backing block is fragmented after boot.

--- a/android/android-emu/android/emulation/address_space_graphics.cpp
+++ b/android/android-emu/android/emulation/address_space_graphics.cpp
