+        // Velox: with VELOX_ASG_DUPLEX=1, reserve the duplex size now. Expanding the buffer
+        // later (kAsgGetDuplexBuffer) must stay inside the context's backing block, and after
+        // boot the blocks are fragmented by short-lived contexts, so the expansion failed for
